### =========================================================================
### 🎓 CHANGE PASSWORD — reauthentication + i-logout ang LAHAT
### 📅 Day 55 · Phase 11 (Mas ligtas na sessions)
### =========================================================================
### POST /api/auth/change-password  { currentPassword, newPassword }   (kailangang naka-login)
###   → kailangan ang KASALUKUYANG password — kahit may nakanakaw ng session, hindi niya ito mapapalitan
###   → sa iisang TRANSACTION: bagong password + bawiin ang LAHAT ng session + bagong session para rito
###   → 204 + bagong cookies (tuloy ka rito) · ang ibang device: na-logout (≤ 15 min ang access token nila)
###   → maling kasalukuyang password: 400 (hindi 401) + audit password_change_failed · 10 palpak / 15 min
###
### Code: backend/src/services/auth/password.service.ts (changePassword, Day 75) · controllers/auth.controller.ts (400 vs 401, cookies) · lib/session.ts (revokeAllSessions)
### Test: routes/change-password.test.ts · change-password-rollback.test.ts · transactions.test.ts (Day 68: pati ang tiwala ng mga device)
### Diagram: docs/diagrams/16-change-password.md · Frontend: /change-password
### =========================================================================

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. Account (isang beses lang — 409 kung mayroon na)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "change-pw-demo@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "change-pw-demo@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Maling kasalukuyang password. Ang inaasahan:
###    400 { "error": "Invalid input", "fields": { "currentPassword": ["Incorrect password"] } }
###    — walang nabago; audit: password_change_failed
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "hula-hula-lang",
  "newPassword": "bagong-password-456"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Parehong password. Ang inaasahan: 400 · fields.newPassword: ["New password must be different ..."]
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "password123",
  "newPassword": "password123"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Tama. Ang inaasahan:
###    204 · Set-Cookie: token=... · refresh_token=... (BAGONG session — tuloy ka rito)
###          · device_token=... (Day 64: binawi ang tiwala ng LAHAT ng ibang device, pinagkakatiwalaan ang client na ito)
### 🔍 Kung naka-login din ang account na ito sa browser: sa "📱 Mga device ko", wala na ito pagkatapos,
###    at ililipat ang browser sa /login kapag nag-expire ang access token nito (≤ 15 min)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "password123",
  "newPassword": "bagong-password-456"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. /me — tuloy pa rin ang session dito. Ang inaasahan: 200
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Login gamit ang LUMANG password. Ang inaasahan: 401
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "change-pw-demo@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Login gamit ang BAGONG password. Ang inaasahan: 200
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "change-pw-demo@example.com",
  "password": "bagong-password-456"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Walang login. Ang inaasahan: 401
# @no-cookie-jar
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "x",
  "newPassword": "yyyyyyyy"
}
